# ============================================================
# FakeLocation .gitignore
# ============================================================
# 关键点：`build/` 与 `.gradle/` 必须**不带前导斜杠**。
# 带斜杠的写法（如 `*/build/`、`/*/build/`）只能匹配一层目录，
# 覆盖不到 core/core-mock/build/、feature/feature-home/build/
# 这类两层路径 —— 曾导致 3500+ 构建产物被误纳入待提交列表。
# ============================================================

# ---------- Gradle / Android 构建产物 ----------
build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/

# ---------- 包产物与内存快照 ----------
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.hprof
*.prof

# ---------- 本地配置与密钥（严禁提交） ----------
local.properties
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
google-services.json

# ---------- IDE ----------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# ---------- 日志与临时文件 ----------
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.patch
*.diff

# ---------- 操作系统 ----------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
